{
  "statement": "I appreciate the collaborative efforts to balance safety and efficiency. I support the idea of integrating user confirmation for withdrawals from the savings account (SAF-02, EFF-05) and propose that this confirmation process should also include a reminder of the potential transaction consequences to enhance user awareness. This way, we can ensure that users are fully informed while still maintaining a seamless transaction experience. Additionally, I emphasize that any modifications should be designed to not compromise security (TRU-01) or increase energy consumption (GRN-01). Let's ensure our solutions promote both safety and sustainability.",
